<title>SINGAPORE: Ssangyong Cement 1st-half net down 19 pct.</title>
<headline>Ssangyong Cement 1st-half net down 19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    9.61   vs  11.81</p>
<p>    Profit per share (cents)	 12.50   vs  15.40</p>
<p>    Turnover			     85.71   vs  75.90</p>
<p>    Investment income		   0.79   vs   1.47</p>
<p>    Other income incl interest	0.96   vs   0.98</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		  0.18   vs   0.07</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortization	 1.83   vs   1.81</p>
<p>    Income from associates	    0.25   vs   0.12</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     13.18   vs  16.35</p>
<p>    Tax				     3.51   vs   4.44</p>
<p>    Minority loss			 0.07   vs   0.10</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Ssangyong Cement (Singapore) Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
